---
description: One task, one worktree, one window
alwaysApply: true
---
Never do feature work on the base branch in the main checkout. Start tasks with
scripts/start-task.sh <slug> [feat|fix|chore|wip], which creates
.worktrees/<slug> on a fresh origin base branch. The main checkout stays clean.
A task is DONE only when merged AND its worktree is removed —
run scripts/worktree-audit.sh to check; `worktree-audit.sh clean --apply`
removes merged+clean ones. Dirty worktrees: stop and ask.
